Neon containers port (M1), part 6 of 7: command line.

--container=<name> and --temporary-container open the command line tabs in a
container, as brave-core v1.100.58 (bd6d26d1) does through StartupTab. This
is also how the M1 test puts tabs in containers without UI. Pinned tab
containers (pinned_tab_codec.cc) are not ported yet.

